TEXT 0 -220 Left 2 ;Lab A part 1 - dual-diaphragm loudspeaker, MOBILITY analogy: node voltage = velocity [m/s], current = force [N]
TEXT 0 -188 Left 2 ;mass -> C to ground, compliance -> L, damper R_M -> resistor 1/R_M.  I = 1 A means F = 1 N
